    "description": "DigitalNZ Records API v3 — search 30M+ items from New Zealand libraries, archives, museums and media, including **Papers Past** (NZ newspapers 1839–1980s, full text). No key needed for public content (unauthenticated requests share a global rate limit); an optional free key gives better throughput. Use source_url (not landing_url) when linking.\n\nDocs: https://digitalnz.org/developers/api-docs-v3 · OpenAPI: https://app.swaggerhub.com/apis-docs/DigitalNZ/Records/3"
  },
